{"version":1,"content":"<p>內地男星張曉龍過去鑽研古代禮儀和服飾，在許多影視中擔任禮儀指導，後來演出劇集《後宮甄嬛傳》「溫太醫（溫實初）」一角而為人熟悉。</p><p>事實上，張曉龍在鏡頭後的生活相當低調，也鮮少與女藝人傳緋聞，沒想到近日有消息傳出，他已經秘密結婚且是3孩之父。</p><p>&amp;l</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T18:18:41.593574+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T18:01:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T18:11:50.938528+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T18:11:50.938528+00:00","content_hash":"2b66d7759ed8d49992837702ecc34b6b81fe7b515e76f6477631f426a6e9fd94","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}